<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015), Park et al. (2015) & Bi et al. (2016) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming, asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition and self-propelled Voronoi motility-driven glass transition — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credits: the module docstring maps every implemented equation to Bi (2015) Eqs. 1-2, Park (2015) Figs. 1-4, Atia (2018) Figs. 1-2 and Bi (2016) Eqs. 1-3 / Figs. 1, 3, 4, names the Lean theorems, and states plainly which part of the script is phenomenological (L1-62); every SPV function docstring cites the equation or figure it implements and the finite-time estimator it uses (L590-606, L635-650, L731-742, L795-822, L927-937, L990-1000, L1049-1056); the math KG YAML registers the two new theorems with code loci. Deductions: the phase-indexed constants of the regime simulator (0.28, 0.18, 0.88, 0.012, 0.065, L336-352, L403-410) and the Park fit coefficients (L532-536) have no cited source (-5); the 0.02 per-free-path threshold and the 0.2/D_r time-step rule are justified only by prototyping notes in docstrings (-3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L403–L410: Uncited drift/noise amplitudes in the phenomenological regime integrator (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L403-L410>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015), Park et al. (2015) & Bi et al. (2016) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming, asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition and self-propelled Voronoi motility-driven glass transition — Model fidelity to source: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credits: the SPV module is a faithful Bi (2016) Eqs. 1-3 implementation — tissue energy with the 2016 prefactor convention (`energy_prefactor=2`, L642), exact dE/dr_i via dA/dh = perp(h_next - h_prev)/2, dP/dh and the closed-form circumcenter Jacobian (L590-606, L635-724), overdamped Euler with polarity noise sqrt(2 D_r dt) (L795-905), FIRE quench (L731-782), D_eff = D_s/D_0 as defined by Bi (L865-872); the energy-minimised <q>(p_0) reproduces Bi (2015) Fig. 2 pinning from the energy alone (L1049-1086); Bi (2015) Eq. 2, the regular-polygon bounds and the k-Gamma PDF are exact (L143-178, L235-247). Deductions: `simulate_vertex_unjamming_regime` (L304-458) sets initial disorder, pure-shear stretch, drift noise and migration speed from phase-indexed tables (L336-352, L403-428) instead of minimising the energy, so Panels A1-A4, the GIF and the p_0 sweep (L460-504) are phenomenological (-5); Delta e_T1 and G are the hard-coded linear law 0.40 r dp and 1.00 r dp (L180-233), not computed from the landscape (-3); the SPV boundary uses a script-defined per-free-path T1 threshold 0.02 (L103, L873) rather than Bi's long-time D_eff < 1e-3 because the T = 150 window leaves a ~5e-3 D_eff floor (-2); the Park trajectories q(t) are closed-form fits (L532-536), not model outputs (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L180–L233: Delta e_T1 = 0.40 r dp and G = 1.00 r dp hard-coded linear law, not computed from the energy landscape (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L180-L233>",
        "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L336–L352: Phase-indexed init_sigma / stretch tables in the regime simulator: phenomenological, not energy-derived (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L336-L352>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity-4> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015), Park et al. (2015) & Bi et al. (2016) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming, asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition and self-propelled Voronoi motility-driven glass transition — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credits: 15 measurements with units and reference values (L1716-1848): the SPV boundary shape index q_c = 3.818 vs Bi (2016) 3.81, the v_0 -> 0 boundary intercept 3.850 vs 3.81, fluidisation slope 0.575 vs the approximate 0.6 +/- 0.3 anchor, T1-rate contrast 45x at fixed p_0 vs a >= 10x expectation, D_r boundary shift +0.071 vs a >= 0 sign expectation, the FIRE-minimised <q>(p_0) r = 0.9966 (RMSE 0.013) vs the Bi (2015) reference curve, and solid-branch <q> = 3.829 vs 3.813, in addition to the 8 Pass 2 metrics; `--self-test` asserts the q_c and p_0^c(0) tolerances (L1961-1970). Deductions: three of the seven new references are expectation/sign-only values written by the script author, not literature numbers (L1762-1775), and the alpha reference is an approximate figure reading (-4); single seed, no confidence intervals on p_0^c or q_c (-3); the intercept 3.850 misses 3.81 by 0.04 with no error bar, and the FIRE solid branch 3.829 overshoots 3.813 (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L1762–L1775: T1-contrast (10x) and D_r-shift (>= 0) references are author expectations, not published values (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L1762-L1775>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-measurement-critical-unjamming-shape-index-p0-star>,
