<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015), Park et al. (2015) & Bi et al. (2016) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming, asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition and self-propelled Voronoi motility-driven glass transition — Morphological realism / specimen match: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credits: Panel A5 overlays N = 101 segmented polygons on the SHA-256-locked human monolayer micrograph with per-cell jammed/unjammed colouring (L1316-1330); Panel B5 matches the Atia (2018) k-Gamma shape distribution (r = 0.933); the new SPV snapshots C1/C2 (L1485-1522) show, at the same p_0 = 3.70, a caged glassy packing with short displacement trails versus a motility-unjammed fluid with long trails and elongated red cells, and Panel C4 reproduces the qualitative Bi (2016) Fig. 1(a) layout (solid lower-left, boundary meeting the p_0 axis near 3.81-3.85); the GIF's new fourth panel animates SPV polarity vectors. Deductions: the specimen is a human corneal endothelium (dataset JSON source_url), not the bronchial epithelium of the biological claim (-6); no side-by-side with a Bi (2016) figure crop or an HBEC micrograph from Park (2015) (-3); the SPV snapshot trails cross periodic boundaries and the polarity arrows are small at the 150 dpi panel size (-2); A1-A4 remain the phenomenological renders (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/vertex_glass_jamming/vertex_glass_jamming_reference.json L33–L42: Specimen provenance: Wikimedia 'Morphology of human corneal endothelium in situ' — corneal endothelium, not bronchial epithelium (deduction) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/datasets/vertex_glass_jamming/vertex_glass_jamming_reference.json#L33-L42>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-specimen-match-2> ;
