<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bi-vertex-glass-jamming-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) Dimensionless Vertex Energy Functional & Target-Shape Ground-State Identity" ;
    dct:description "Governs mechanical force balance in confluent epithelial monolayers where competition between cortical contractility and cell-cell adhesion sets the target shape index p_0 | Variables: a_i: normalized cell area A_i/A_0; p_i: normalized cell perimeter P_i/sqrt(A_0); p_0: target cell shape index P_0/sqrt(A_0); r: dimensionless perimeter-to-area elasticity ratio K_P/(K_A A_0)" ;
    dct:source "Bi, Lopez, Schwarz & Manning (2015) Nature Physics 11(12):1074-1079 Eqs. (1)-(2)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L143-L233>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean#L20-L53> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def two_cell_vertex_energy (a_i a_0 r p_i p_0 : Int) : Int :=
  (a_i - a_0) * (a_i - a_0) + r * (p_i - p_0) * (p_i - p_0)
theorem bi_vertex_energy_nonneg_and_ground_state_zero (a_0 r p_i p_0 d : Int) :
    area_deviation_sq a_0 a_0 = 0 ∧
    two_cell_vertex_energy a_0 a_0 r p_0 p_0 = 0 ∧
    two_cell_vertex_energy a_0 a_0 r p_i p_0 = r * shape_index_deviation_sq p_i p_0 ∧
    0 <= d * d"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "e = \\frac{E}{K_A A_0^2} = \\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{i=1}^N \\left[(a_i - 1)^2 + r(p_i - p_0)^2\\right],\\quad a_i = \\frac{A_i}{A_0},\\ p_i = \\frac{P_i}{\\sqrt{A_0}},\\ r = \\frac{K_P}{K_A A_0},\\ p_0 = \\frac{P_0}{\\sqrt{A_0}}" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.170201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Zero-Temperature Shape-Index Unjamming (Bi-Manning Vertex Rigidity Transition & Asthmatic Bronchial Epithelial Jamming)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.two_cell_vertex_energy" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.bi_vertex_energy_nonneg_and_ground_state_zero" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bi-vertex-glass-jamming-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Regular Hexagon, Pentagon & Critical Unjamming Shape-Index Bounds (p_hex < p_5 < p_0^*)" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the geometric bounds separating ordered hexagonal crystals (p_hex ≈ 3.722) from the disordered pentagonal/polygonal jamming threshold (p_0^* ≈ 3.813) | Variables: p_hex: regular hexagon shape index (2*sqrt(2*sqrt(3)) ≈ 3.7224); p_5: regular pentagon shape index (≈ 3.8119); p_0^*: disordered confluent rigidity transition point (≈ 3.813)" ;
    dct:source "Bi, Lopez, Schwarz & Manning (2015) Nature Physics 11(12):1074-1079 pp. 1074-1076 & Fig. 2" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L96-L233>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean#L55-L83> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def p_hex_milli : Int := 3722
def p_pent_milli : Int := 3812
def p0_star_milli : Int := 3813
theorem shape_index_hexagon_pentagon_critical_bounds :
    (p_hex_milli * p_hex_milli < p_pent_milli * p_pent_milli) ∧
    (p_pent_milli * p_pent_milli < p0_star_milli * p0_star_milli) ∧
    (p_hex_10k ^ 4 < 192 * (10000 ^ 4)) ∧ (192 * (10000 ^ 4) < (p_hex_10k + 1) ^ 4)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "p_{\\text{hex}} = \\sqrt{8\\sqrt{3}} \\approx 3.7224 < p_5 = \\sqrt{20\\tan(\\pi/5)} \\approx 3.8119 < p_0^* \\approx 3.813;\\quad p_{\\text{hex}}^2 \\approx 13.856 < (p_0^*)^2 \\approx 14.539" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.170201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Zero-Temperature Shape-Index Unjamming (Bi-Manning Vertex Rigidity Transition & Asthmatic Bronchial Epithelial Jamming)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.p0_star_milli" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.shape_index_hexagon_pentagon_critical_bounds" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bi-vertex-glass-jamming-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Zero-Temperature T1 Energy Barrier & Shear Modulus Vanishing Above Critical Shape Index p_0^*" ;
    dct:description "Proves that tissue rigidity and T1 rearrangement barriers vanish identically for p_0 >= p_0^* = 3.813 and separates jammed non-asthmatic bronchial epithelium (q_14 = 3.792 < 3.813) from unjammed asthmatic epithelium (q_14 = 3.955 > 3.813) | Variables: Δe_T1(p_0): dimensionless T1 topological neighbor-exchange energy barrier; G(p_0): macroscopic static shear modulus; q = <P_i/sqrt(A_i)>: observed cell shape index in human bronchial epithelium" ;
    dct:source "Bi et al. (2015) Nature Physics 11:1074-1079 Figs. 2-3; Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials 14:1040-1048 Figs. 1-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L180-L458>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean#L85-L148> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def t1_barrier_scaled (r p0 p0_star : Int) : Int :=
  if p0 < p0_star then r * (p0_star - p0) else 0
theorem unjamming_rigidity_and_t1_barrier_vanishing
    (r p_fluid p_solid p1 p2 p0_star : Int)
    (h_fluid : p0_star <= p_fluid) (h_solid : p_solid < p0_star)
    (h_order : p1 < p2) (h_sub : p2 <= p0_star) :
    t1_barrier_scaled r p_fluid p0_star = 0 ∧
    t1_barrier_scaled 1 p_solid p0_star > 0 ∧
    t1_barrier_scaled 1 p2 p0_star < t1_barrier_scaled 1 p1 p0_star"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "\\Delta e_{\\text{T1}}(p_0),\\ G(p_0) \\propto r(p_0^* - p_0)_+^\\beta = \\begin{cases} > 0 & p_0 < p_0^* \\approx 3.813 \\text{ (solid jammed)} \\\\ 0 & p_0 \\ge p_0^* \\approx 3.813 \\text{ (fluid unjammed)} \\end{cases}" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.170201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Zero-Temperature Shape-Index Unjamming (Bi-Manning Vertex Rigidity Transition & Asthmatic Bronchial Epithelial Jamming)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.t1_barrier_scaled" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.unjamming_rigidity_and_t1_barrier_vanishing" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bi-vertex-glass-jamming-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2016) Self-Propelled Voronoi Motility-Driven Glass Transition — Motility Lowers the Critical Shape Index (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Closes the Pass 2 remediation item: couples the Bi (2015) vertex energy to active Brownian motility, maps the (p_0, v_0, D_r) glass transition surface, and proves that the boundary meets the zero-motility rigidity point and is monotonically lowered by motility with fluidity inherited upward in v_0 | Variables: v_0: self-propulsion speed; D_r: rotational diffusion (persistence time 1/D_r); n_i: polarity unit vector; F_i = -grad_i E: exact Voronoi energy gradient (circumcenter Jacobians); p_0^c(v_0): glass-transition target shape index; alpha: motility susceptibility of the boundary (simulated 0.58 at D_r = 1)" ;
    dct:source "Bi, Yang, Marchetti & Manning (2016) Physical Review X 6(2):021011 Eqs. (1)-(3), Figs. 1, 3-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L569-L1087>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean#L155-L192> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def motility_shifted_p0c (p0_star alpha v0 : Int) : Int :=
  p0_star - alpha * v0
theorem spv_motility_lowers_critical_shape_index
    (p0_star alpha v0 v1 v2 p0 : Int)
    (h_alpha : 0 < alpha) (h_v0 : 0 < v0) (h_order : v1 < v2)
    (h_fluid_v1 : motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha v1 <= p0) :
    motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha 0 = p0_star ∧
    motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha v0 < p0_star ∧
    motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha v2 < motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha v1 ∧
    motility_shifted_p0c p0_star alpha v2 <= p0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "\\dot{\\mathbf r}_i = \\mu \\mathbf F_i + v_0 \\hat{\\mathbf n}_i,\\ \\mathbf F_i = -\\nabla_i E,\\ \\dot\\theta_i = \\eta_i,\\ \\langle\\eta_i(t)\\eta_j(t')\\rangle = 2D_r\\delta_{ij}\\delta(t-t');\\quad p_0^c(v_0) = p_0^* - \\alpha v_0,\\ \\alpha > 0,\\ p_0^c(0) = p_0^* \\approx 3.81" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.170201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Zero-Temperature Shape-Index Unjamming (Bi-Manning Vertex Rigidity Transition & Asthmatic Bronchial Epithelial Jamming)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.motility_shifted_p0c" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.spv_motility_lowers_critical_shape_index" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bi-vertex-glass-jamming-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Free Active-Brownian Diffusivity Normalisation D_0 = v_0^2 / (2 D_r) of the SPV Effective Diffusivity D_eff = D_s / D_0 (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Guarantees the motility normalisation of the SPV order parameter is well defined and strictly increasing in v_0 for every v_0 > 0, so D_eff and the analogous per-free-path T1 rate Gamma_T1 / v_0 compare slow and fast active fluids on one scale | Variables: D_0: free active-Brownian diffusivity; D_s: long-time self-diffusivity from the time-origin-averaged MSD; D_eff: Bi (2016) dynamical order parameter (solid if D_eff < 1e-3 at long times; finite-window floor ~5e-3 here)" ;
    dct:source "Bi, Yang, Marchetti & Manning (2016) Physical Review X 6(2):021011 Fig. 1 and Sec. II (D_eff definition)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L784-L905>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/7e4f207/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean#L193-L214> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def free_active_diffusivity_numer (v0 : Int) : Int := v0 * v0
theorem spv_free_active_diffusivity_monotone_in_motility
    (v0 v1 v2 : Int) (h_v0 : 0 < v0) (h_nonneg : 0 <= v1) (h_order : v1 < v2) :
    free_active_diffusivity_numer 0 = 0 ∧
    0 < free_active_diffusivity_numer v0 ∧
    free_active_diffusivity_numer v1 < free_active_diffusivity_numer v2"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "D_0 = \\frac{v_0^2}{2 D_r},\\quad D_{\\text{eff}} = \\frac{D_s}{D_0},\\ D_s = \\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\frac{\\langle|\\Delta\\mathbf r(t)|^2\\rangle}{4t};\\quad 0 \\le v_1 < v_2 \\Rightarrow v_1^2 < v_2^2" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.170201>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Zero-Temperature Shape-Index Unjamming (Bi-Manning Vertex Rigidity Transition & Asthmatic Bronchial Epithelial Jamming)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.free_active_diffusivity_numer" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_045.spv_free_active_diffusivity_monotone_in_motility" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

